-- c001-v001: Paulos, prairit Khristos–ke Yeshu, ke-dwara ichchha Parameshwar–ki, ke-anusaar vachan jivan–ka us mein Khristos Yeshu,
-- c001-v002: Timothiyos–ko priye putr: anugrah, daya, shanti se Parameshwar Pita, aur Khristos Yeshu hamare Prabhu hamare.
-- c001-v003: Dhanyavaad hai–mujhe us Parameshwar–ka, jis–ki seva–karta–hoon, se poorvajon, mein shuddh antahkaran, jaisa lagatar hai–mujhe woh ke-baare-mein teri smriti, mein meri praarthanaon meri, raat aur din,
-- c001-v004: chaahte-hue tujhe dekhna, yaad–karte-hue tere un aansuon, taaki anand–se bhar–jaaoon;
-- c001-v005: smaran paakr us mein tujh nishkapat vishwaas, jo pahle–basa pahle mein teri naani teri, Lois, aur teri maata teri, Eunikē; vishwaas–hai–mujhe aur ki bhi mein tujh.
-- c001-v006: Is jis kaaran yaad–dilaata–hoon tujhe phir–jalaana us vardan Parameshwar–ka Parameshwar–ka, jo hai mein tujh ke-dwara us rakhne mere haathon mere.
-- c001-v007: nahin kyonki diya hamen us Parameshwar–ne aatma bhay–ki, parantu shakti–ki, aur prem–ki, aur sanyam–ki.
-- c001-v008: Mat to lajjit–ho us sakshi hamare Prabhu–ki hamare, na–hi mujh us bandi uske; parantu dukh–uthaao–saath us sushmaachaar, ke-anusaar shakti Parameshwar–ki;
-- c001-v009: us–ne bachaaya hamen, aur bulaaya bulahat–se pavitra, nahin ke-anusaar un karmon hamare, parantu ke-anusaar apni yojana aur anugrah, us diya–gaya hamen mein Khristos Yeshu se–pahle samay anant;
-- c001-v010: pragtit–hua aur ab, ke-dwara us pragatya hamare Uddharkarta hamare, Khristos Yeshu, naash–kiya to us mrityu–ko, prakashit–kiya aur jivan aur amar-bhaav, ke-dwara us sushmaachaar;
-- c001-v011: ke-liye jis niyukt–kiya–gaya main pracharit, aur prairit, aur shikshak.
-- c001-v012: is jis kaaran bhi ye dukh–uthata–hoon. parantu nahin lajjit–hota; jaanta–hoon kyonki jis–par vishwaas–kiya, aur vishwaas–hai–mujhe ki samarth hai, us dharohar meri rakshit–karna, tak us us din.
-- c001-v013: aadarsh rakh svasth vachanon, jo se mujh suna, mein vishwaas aur prem, us mein Khristos Yeshu.
-- c001-v014: us bhalee dharohar surakshit–rakh, ke-dwara Aatma Pavitra, jo vaas–karta–hai mein hum.
-- c001-v015: Jaanta–hai ye, ki phir–gaye mujh–se sab woh mein us Asiyaa, jin–mein hai Phugelos, aur Hermogenēs.
-- c001-v016: de daya woh Prabhu, us Onēsiphoros ghar, kyonki aksar mujhe tazgee–di, aur us zanjeer meri nahin lajjit–hua;
-- c001-v017: parantu hokar mein Rom, lagn–se dhoondha mujhe aur paaya.
-- c001-v018: de use woh Prabhu, paana daya se Prabhu, mein us us din! aur kitni mein Ephesos seva–ki behtar, tu jaanta–hai.
-- c002-v001: Tu to, putr mera, mazboot–ho mein us anugrah jo mein Khristos Yeshu.
-- c002-v002: aur jo suna se mujh ke-dwara bahut gawaahon, ye saunp vishwaasyogya manushyon, jo yogya honge bhi doosron–ko sikhaane.
-- c002-v003: dukh–uthaa–saath jaise achchha sainik Khristos Yeshu.
-- c002-v004: koi–nahin sainik–hokar ulajhta un us jivan kaamon, taaki us bharti–karnewale, prasann–kare.
-- c002-v005: yadi aur bhi prati–spardha–kare koi, nahin mukut–paata, yadi nahin niyam–se prati–spardha–kare.
-- c002-v006: us mehnat–karnewale kisaan–ko chahiye pahle un falon mein–bhagi–hona.
-- c002-v007: samajh jo kahta–hoon; dega kyonki tujhe woh Prabhu samajh mein sab.
-- c002-v008: Yaad–rakh Yeshu Khristos, jivit–kiya–gaya se murdon, se vansh Daood, ke-anusaar us sushmaachaar mera,
-- c002-v009: mein jis dukh–uthata–hoon, tak bandhanon jaise aparaadhi. parantu woh vachan Parameshwar–ka Parameshwar–ka nahin bandha!
-- c002-v010: is–liye ye, sab sahta–hoon ke-liye un chunon, taaki bhi woh uddhaar paayen, jo mein Khristos Yeshu, ke-saath mahima anant.
-- c002-v011: Vishwaasyogya woh vachan: yadi kyonki saath–mare, bhi saath–jiyenge;
-- c002-v012: yadi sahte–hain, bhi saath–raaj–karenge; yadi inkaar–karenge, woh–bhi inkaar–karega hamen;
-- c002-v013: yadi avishwaas–karte, woh vishwaasyogya rahta; inkaar–karna kyonki apne–aap, nahin sakta.
-- c002-v014: Ye yaad–dila, sakshi–dete–hue saamne us Parameshwar mat shabd–ladaai–karna -- ke-liye kisi upyog, par vinaash un sunnewaalon.
-- c002-v015: prayaas–kar apne–aap–ko, pramaanik prastut–karna us Parameshwar, kaaryakartaa nirlajj, theek–se–baantne-waala us vachan us satya;
-- c002-v016: un aur ashuddh, vyarth–baaton door–reh, tak zyaada kyonki badhhenge adharm;
-- c002-v017: aur unka vachan unka jaise sadi–hua–ghaav faileega rahega; jin–mein hai Humenaios, aur Philētos;
-- c002-v018: jo ke-baare-mein us satya bhatak–gaye, kahte–hue [woh] punarutthan pahle–hi ho–gaya; aur ulat–dete–hain us kuchh vishwaas.
-- c002-v019: woh parantu, dridhh neenv Parameshwar–ki Parameshwar–ki khadhi–hai, rakhti–hai us muhar ye: Jaana Prabhu–ne un hone-waale uske, aur, Door–rahe se apaadharmi har woh naam–lenewala us naam Prabhu–ka.
-- c002-v020: mein bade aur ghar, nahin hai sirf bartan sone aur chaandi, parantu bhi lakdi aur mitti; aur kuchh to ke-liye sammaan, kuchh aur ke-liye apmaan.
-- c002-v021: yadi to koi shuddh–kare apne–aap se in, hoga bartan ke-liye sammaan, pavitra–kiya–gaya, upyogi us swami, ke-liye har kaam bhalee taiyaar.
-- c002-v022: un aur javaan ichchhaon bhaag; peechha–kar aur dharmiktaa, vishwaas, prem, shanti ke-saath un pukaarne-waalon us Prabhu se shuddh hriday.
-- c002-v023: un aur moorkh aur agyaani vivaadon, tyaag–de, jaante–hue ki janm–dete–hain jhagdon.
-- c002-v024: daas aur Prabhu–ka, nahin chahiye jhagadnaa, parantu narm hona ke-prati sabon, shikshak, sahansheela,
-- c002-v025: mein narmtaa sikhlaanewale un virodh–karnewaalon, kahin kabhi de unhen woh Parameshwar pashchataap, ke-liye samajh satya,
-- c002-v026: aur hosh–mein–aayen se us, us Shaitan, jaal pakde–gaye, ke-dwara uske ke-liye us uski ichchha.
-- c003-v001: Ye aur jaan–le, ki mein antim dinon aayenge samay kathin;
-- c003-v002: honge kyonki woh manushya sva-premi, dhan-premi, ghamandi, ahankaari, nindak, maata-pita–ke avagya, akritgya, apavitra,
-- c003-v003: sneh-heen, nirdayi, doshi, asanyami, kroor, bhalaayi–ke-virodhi,
-- c003-v004: vishwaasghati, utaawle, ghamand–se–bhari, bhog-premi zyaada balki Parameshwar-premi;
-- c003-v005: rakhne-waale roop bhakti, us aur shakti uski inkaar–kiya. aur in door–reh.
-- c003-v006: se in kyonki, hain woh ghus–janewale mein un gharon, aur bandi–banaanewale kamzor–mahilaon, bhari paapon, chali ichchhaon vividh,
-- c003-v007: hamesha seekhte–hue, aur kabhi–nahin mein samajh satya aane samarth.
-- c003-v008: jis prakaar aur Yannēs aur Yambrēs virodh–kiye Mooshey, aise bhi ye virodh–karte us satya, manushya bigde–hue us mann, naakaabil ke-baare-mein us vishwaas.
-- c003-v009: parantu nahin badhhenge tak zyaada, woh kyonki moorkhta unki pragtit hogi sabon, jaise bhi woh unki hui.
-- c003-v010: Tu aur anusaran–kiya mera us shiksha, us aacharan, us uddeshya, us vishwaas, us dheertaa, us prem, us dheeraj,
-- c003-v011: un sataavon, un dukh: jo mujhe hue mein Antaakiyaa, mein Ikoniyon, mein Lustra; kaisi sataavon sahi; aur se sabon, mujhe bachaaya us Prabhu–ne.
-- c003-v012: aur sab aur, jo chaahte jeena bhakti–se mein Khristos Yeshu, sataaye–jaayenge.
-- c003-v013: bure aur manushya aur dhokhebaaz badhhenge tak us bura, bhatkaanewale aur bhatke–hue.
-- c003-v014: tu aur bana–rah mein jin seekha, aur vishwaas–kiya, jaante–hue se kinse seekha;
-- c003-v015: aur ki se bachpan [woh] pavitra lekhon jaanta–hai, jo samarth tujhe buddhi–dene ke-liye uddhaar, ke-dwara vishwaas, us mein Khristos Yeshu.
-- c003-v016: sab shastra Parameshwar-nisvaasit aur laabhdaayak ke-liye shiksha, ke-liye dokhh-dena, ke-liye sudhaarna, ke-liye shikshit–karna us mein dharmiktaa,
-- c003-v017: taaki poorn ho woh us Parameshwar–ka manushya, ke-liye har kaam bhalee siddh.
-- c004-v001: Sakshi–deta–hoon saamne us Parameshwar aur Khristos Yeshu, jo aane-waala nyaay–karnewala jiviton aur murdon, aur us pragatya uska, aur us raajya uska:
-- c004-v002: prachaar–kar us vachan; taiyaar–rah samay–par, besamay; taa, daant, samjhaa, mein sabhi dheertaa aur shiksha.
-- c004-v003: hoga kyonki samay jab us svasth shiksha nahin sahenge; parantu ke-anusaar un apni ichchhaon, apne–liye ikattha–karenge shikshakon, khujlaanewale un kaanon;
-- c004-v004: aur se to us satya, un kaanon pher–lenge, tak aur un kathaon phir–jaayenge.
-- c004-v005: tu aur, sacheta–rah mein sabon, dukh–uthaa, kaam kar sushmaachaar–pracharak, us seva teri poori–kar.
-- c004-v006: Main kyonki ab balidaan–hota–hoon, aur woh samay us prasthaan mera aa–pahuncha.
-- c004-v007: us bhalee ladaayi ladha; woh daur poori–ki; us vishwaas rakha.
-- c004-v008: ab–se rakha–hai mere–liye woh us dharmiktaa mukut, jo dega mujhe woh Prabhu, mein us us din, woh dharmik nyaayi; nahin sirf aur mujhe, parantu bhi sab un prem–karnewaalon us pragatya uska.
-- c004-v009: Jaldi–kar aane pas mere jaldi,
-- c004-v010: Dēmas kyonki mujhe chhod–diya, prem–karke is vartamaan sansaar, aur chala–gaya ko Thessalonikē; Krēskēs ko Galatiyaa; Titos ko Dalmatiyaa.
-- c004-v011: Loukas hai akela ke-saath mere. Markos, lekar, laa ke-saath apne, hai kyonki mujhe upyogi ke-liye seva.
-- c004-v012: Tuchikos aur bheja ko Ephesos.
-- c004-v013: woh choga jo chhoda mein Troas pas Karpos, aate-hue laa, aur woh kitaabein, khaaskr woh chamadon.
-- c004-v014: Aleksandros woh lohar, bahut mujhe buraai dikhaaya. dega use woh Prabhu, ke-anusaar un karmon uske,
-- c004-v015: jis–se bhi tu bach, bahut kyonki virodh–kiya un hamaare vachanon.
-- c004-v016: Mein us pahli meri prativaad, koi–nahin mere saath–khada, parantu sab mujhe chhod–gaye. mat unhen gina–jaaye!
-- c004-v017: woh aur Prabhu mujhe saath–khada, aur shakti–di mujhe, taaki ke-dwara mere woh prachaar poora–ho, aur sunen sab woh deshon; aur bachaaya–gaya se munh sher.
-- c004-v018: bachaayega mujhe woh Prabhu se har kaam bure, aur bachaayega mein us raajya uska woh swargiya; jis–ko woh mahima mein un yugon un yugon. Amen.
-- c004-v019: Namaskar Priska aur Akulas, aur us Onēsiphoros ghar.
-- c004-v020: Erastos raha mein Korinthos, Trophimos aur chhoda mein Milētos bimaar.
-- c004-v021: Jaldi–kar se–pahle sardi aana. Namaskar–karata–hai tujhe Euboulos, aur Poudēs, aur Linos, aur Klaudia, aur woh bhai sab.
-- c004-v022: Woh Prabhu ke-saath us aatma tera. woh anugrah ke-saath tumhaare. <Amen>.

